			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Conulaf"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751570101,
					"content": "*sob* I did not expect to be locked up in this cage... My dignity as one of the Masters of the Night-Wind is all but gone now, surely!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570102,
					"content": "A disgrace to the tribe, a disgrace indeed...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570103,
					"content": "You again? What happened this time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751570104,
					"content": "Ah, my savior, we meet again... *sigh* I'm sorry you had to see that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570105,
					"content": "Ah, did I not say previously that my name is Conulaf, a trainee priest of the Masters of the Night-Wind?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570106,
					"content": "As the name suggests, I'm presently in training to become a priest. And... Well, our tribal elders told me that my ancestor, Sanhaj, used to get into betting battles with people from other tribes, often tricking them silly in the process.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570107,
					"content": "And so the elders said, \"Go make and win some bets! That's the only way to qualify as a true Master of the Night-Wind!\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570108,
					"content": "So when I passed by and saw a tournament taking place, I... I made a bet too. I mean, who cares if you've got a \"defending Tepetlisaurus champion\" or a \"Qucusaurus, the decade's strongest rookie\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570109,
					"content": "Our Iktomisaurs would be the strongest, naturally!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570110,
					"content": "That's what I thought, anyway... but I bet on the wrong Saurian.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570111,
					"content": "Not only did I wind up in debt, but I got locked in here to boot...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570112,
					"content": "\"Heh, tell you what,\" they said. \"We'll give you ten times your Mora back if the Iktomisaurus emerges the champ. If not, you can just stay in this cage, alright?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570113,
					"content": "What should I do now? Oh, if only there was an Iktomisaurus who could give those other two Saurians a good thumping...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570114,
					"content": "That way, I could get out of here, and get ten times the Mora too! ... Ah, I mean, most importantly, we can't have those two tribes look down on our wonderful Iktomisaurs!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570115,
					"content": "*sob* Please, dear savior. If you could find such an Iktomisaurus...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570116,
					"content": "*sigh* I probably shouldn't spout such nonsense. You're not of our tribe anyway — where are you supposed to just find an Iktomisaurus like that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570117,
					"content": "I'll see about finding one...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751570118,
					"content": "R—Really, could you? I—In that case, I'm just going to stay in this cage and wait for an update from you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				}
			]
		},
