			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751570201,
					"content": "The Iktomisaurus makes a sudden, dynamic entrance and defeats the original victor, the \"Crimson Dancer.\"\\nAs agreed, the organizer frees the reckless young lady from the Masters of the Night-Wind...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751570202,
					"content": "*sob* Ohhh... I thought I was about to be sent home in a cage, my family forced to pay my debts...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570203,
					"content": "And while I was in there, I suddenly remembered that our ancestors would stack the deck first before betting, which is how they'd win...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570204,
					"content": "So, yes, I had much time for self-reflection while in this cage — you know, about my unrealistic expectations of beating others at their own game.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570205,
					"content": "I don't know where you managed to find such a powerful Iktomisaurus...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570206,
					"content": "But I'm grateful all the same! With your help, I've recovered my investment, and even earned back ten times the Mora I put in!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570207,
					"content": "I, on the other hand, barely did anything... But I'll need to find a soft bed to lie down on all the same. My back hurts all over from being stuck in this cage for half a day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751570208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 751570208,
					"content": "As for the winnings, you keep them, dear savior! The elders said that keeping an unexpected windfall close will only bring one misfortune, so it's best I give it away!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				}
			]
		},
